Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:10.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕组制作 仅供学习交流 禁止用于商业用途
Comment: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:08.00,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:17.09,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:31.51,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}飲み込まれた 怪物の胃袋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:39.70,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}あれからずっと 絡みつく錆びた鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:47.36,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}気づかずにいたなら 闇でも怖くなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:55.63,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:10.59,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}切り裂いてその剣で 本当の世界見せて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:22.36,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}猛毒に溶け出して 私でなくなる前に
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:31.04,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 千切れない罪と私を
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:38.13,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}二度ともう戻れない 不条理な目覚めね
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:45.80,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 奈落へと連れて行って
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:50.32,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}もう忘れない まだ痛い
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:53.73,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}君のこと ケシたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:17.09,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 这不公的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:31.51,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}被怪物吞食 落入胃中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:39.70,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}自那之后 始终身缠生锈锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:47.36,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}若视而不见 则不畏黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:55.63,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 这不公的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:10.59,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}用那把剑披荆斩棘 让我看到真实的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:22.36,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}在我被剧毒溶解 失去自我之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:31.04,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 将我与罪孽分离
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:38.13,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}再也无法回头 这残酷的苏醒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:45.80,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 将我带入地狱深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:50.32,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}无法遗忘 痛无止境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:53.73,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}只想将你 一笔抹消
Comment: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:40.99,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.25,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ワルツを踊る
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:10.93,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}この世界でどうか手を離さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:16.24,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何度となく 行き交うかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.91,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}愛しさを躱さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:25.93,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつしか秘密が普通へと変わり果てても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:32.92,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは期待していられるかな ねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:37.49,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}強がってなくちゃ崩れきって消える
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:42.67,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}魔法とすら呼べないこの願いを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:47.09,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「捨てた方が楽」 多分そうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:51.42,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:56.73,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは 恐れを振り解き 幕は開けて来た
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:23:01.90,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}あの過去はいまと共に在ることを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.23,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「忘れた方が楽」 たとえそうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:12.56,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:20.14,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:26.68,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.25,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}跳起华尔兹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:10.93,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在这个世界 请不要松开这双手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:16.24,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一次又一次 悲伤交汇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.91,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}请不要回避这份爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:25.93,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不知不觉中 秘密已化为寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:32.92,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们是否还能心怀期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:37.49,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若不故作坚强 便会崩塌消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:42.67,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这无法称为魔法的祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:47.09,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使将其舍弃才更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:51.42,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依旧无止境地描绘螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:56.73,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们抛开恐惧 大幕渐起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:23:01.90,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那段过去如今也与我们同在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:06.23,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使将其忘却才更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:12.56,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依旧无止境地描绘螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:20.14,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们的华尔兹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:26.68,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们的华尔兹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 逃进森林里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是要多逃一逃 才有打猎的趣味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,被诅咒的森林吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,迷信而已 你难道还真信？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是狼人守护的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被狼人发现 将受到诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吓人 那老太太怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 痴呆了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,继续往前走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,狐狸在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,狗怎么在低吼…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,刚 刚才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是…狼人…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,莱纳特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是你啊 吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,狩猎的收获如何啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？莱纳特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,您流鼻血了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,莱纳特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 怎么了 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,莱纳特 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,布里格先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「幸会」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕透了 发音很难听
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:13.38,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准雅宋_GBK\blur3\fsp5\fscx95\bord0.5\fs50\b1\3c&H000000&\3a&H6E&\fad(516,522)\pos(1617,892)}那位执事 探访
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ich freue mich, Sie kennenzulernen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了 快晕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不像样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅长德语的发音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,反正能看懂 这不就行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,德国…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fad(519,0)\fs47\bord3\pos(599.67,970.33)}今日甜点 核桃蛋糕配咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对 德国发生了离奇死亡案
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,女王命令我去调查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要您亲自前往吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,凡多姆海伍家的使命是管理英国地下社会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 为什么还要被派到德国去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的小弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,德国南部接连有人离奇死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,身体健康的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,某一天突然变得相貌畸形 随后丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,德国是威廉…我外孙统治的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我家人的故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是传染病 我会立刻派出医疗援助
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但威利和德国政府 都没有给出明确答复
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.11,0:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,德国没有答复 也就无法公开派遣使者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,便决定派您前往了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,以前也有一次追查案件追到了国外
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不明白为什么这次要特地派我出国
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要询问一下明确的理由呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,反正肯定会被糊弄过去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,作为看门狗 只需要屁颠屁颠追着骨头跑就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,凡多姆海伍家的情报网
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,遍布欧洲和亚洲的地下社会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下也可能是想依靠这些情报
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 德国还有前任当家时期就有交往的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,派克劳斯去见那个人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你去联系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见了啊 克劳斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 突然委托你工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 你的执事还真是神出鬼没啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在芬兰蒸桑拿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,结果他突然出现 吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,多有冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还好你这次的旅行地就在不远处
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟之前有一次 你竟跑到地球另一侧去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老人唯一的乐趣就是旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,事不宜迟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,说说您想听的 我在德国的见闻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚到德国就立刻去见那人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可他说很忙 不愿见我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,无奈之下 我便亲自去了事发地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是个穷乡僻壤 折腾死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拜访了出现死者的村子和人家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但并没有传染病流行的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而且死者没有旧疾 也没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我询问了死因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,结果每个人都回答说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,「是魔女的诅咒」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,魔女？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,死者的年龄和性别各异 但有一个共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在死亡前 都去过一座森林
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,伐乌鲁夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在当地被称为魔域或者禁区
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就是座神乎其神的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伐乌鲁夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是…狼人森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,14到17世纪 德国南部发生过惨烈的魔女狩猎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,幸存下来的魔女 逃到了一座森林里定居
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她们为了保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,便在森林里放出了使魔 也就是狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,自那以后 森林就被称为伐乌鲁夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.63,zhu-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1237.34,980)}狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,并有了踏入森林就会被魔女诅咒的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,诅咒能杀人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,简直荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 只获得了这种情报
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我才要道歉 辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,看来还是只能亲自去一趟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 还有一件事想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,葬仪屋失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你从前任当家时期就和他有来往
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,应该比我更了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都好 我需要情报
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜我们几乎不会互相干涉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 前任当家…文森特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在认识我之前 就已经认识葬仪屋了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而在葬仪屋之前认识文森特的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也就只有那人了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟他们从上学时就认识了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那么执行任务时 是否要顺道拜访一下那位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好要去德国
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但那个德国美人…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不 前美人的防守很坚固
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你可要想办法攻陷他哦 少年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只能祈祷我去找他的时候 他心情很好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 去准备车票
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes my lord
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么父子俩都这么会给人找麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 那小子也13岁了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一定越来越像他爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 塞巴斯蒂安 这是什么语啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,西弗兰肯语 德国南部的方言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这方言也太难懂了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这我德语不是白学了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不论学什么语言 打好基础都很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 他在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,「俺才不要被魔女诅咒死」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:12:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「恁给再多钱都白搭」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他看到了被诅咒的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:08.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}你见过被诅咒的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:11.75,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}见过！那叫一个惨不忍睹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:18.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}脸肿成两倍大 全身皮肤都溶解了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:25.60,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}其中一个当场就死了 另一个人也受了刺激 精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:27.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}有幸存者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:28.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:35.32,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}听说那人一直瑟瑟发抖 喊着「狼人来了！」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:36.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}那个人在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:47.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}他是村郊的富人家 布里格家的长子 但现在不在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:57.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}政府担心是传染病 派人把他接到大医院去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:59.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}死掉的那人也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有幸存者 但精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不停喊着「狼人来了」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,难道他看到狼人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,政府的人把他和另一个死者一起 送去大医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要把全国的医院找一遍吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,都精神失常了 问不出什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还不如直接去伐乌鲁夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不管出多少钱 他都不愿意载我们去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那你这么问
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「你的马车卖多少钱」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,巴鲁托 你好下流
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是啊 我都坐了一天多了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 这次难得带上了我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:02.95,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}不好意思 麻烦把球扔过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.24,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}我扔了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:09.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你会说德语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是丹恩说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 会一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,马车已经备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请把行李装上车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是伐乌鲁夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太阴森了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪说被诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,指南针也失灵了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定地下有矿藏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定是诅咒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么连你都这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您使役恶魔 结识死神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,却不相信诅咒 实在是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,连接我与您的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也是一种诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但实际上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,魔女只是在荒唐的审判中被诬陷的普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,并不会在天上飞或者召唤风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,诅咒这种超自然的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,相信它才奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,…大概…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那你见过真正的魔女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我见过几次被称为魔女的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在魔女集会上被召唤出来 被崇拜了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,召唤恶魔并加以崇拜…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不认为真正的集会是以此为目的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,逃避现实的成年人沉迷色欲的社交场…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这或许才是实际情况
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为实现愿望而献出灵魂…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只有拥有如此觉悟 才能召唤出我们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不过也有会随性回应召唤的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷 请看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,森林里真的有村庄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人也没有啊 是荒村吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,房屋都保养得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可以确定有人居住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:45.40,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}都出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好热烈的欢迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}你们是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}怎么进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.19,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这个村子里只有女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 这是几百年前的装束啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她们 我想见这里的领主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.01,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}我们无意加害你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.54,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}能带我们去见领主吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.14,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:14.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}想见领主大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}难道他们是冲着沙利文大人来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 她们在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:21.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:23.73,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}你们该不会是…告密者？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:26.94,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}告密者？不是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}告密者别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:31.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}别以为能活着离开
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:35.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}告密者去死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:38.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}这是在闹什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}沙 沙利文大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:46.92,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}非常抱歉 有人入侵了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}您就是领主…沙利文大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:51.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}正是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:54.80,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}我叫齐格琳德·沙利文
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,1068)}是这座森林的领主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫齐格琳德·沙利文
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是这座森林的领主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小女孩…是领主？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子是哪个地盘的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 沃尔夫拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 毕竟很久没有外人来过了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怎 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道你们是怎么来到这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这座村庄被称为「狼谷」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不允许任何外人驻留
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了就快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就先撤退 想好对策再来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那我们就…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:18:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,平安穿过森林是有多幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你们不明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,此话怎讲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不可能不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这座森林里存在守护者 狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这里真的是狼人守护的魔女之村吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔夫拉姆大人 他们很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,必须立刻处理掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐 这不妥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不听我的命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是现在返回 不等穿出森林就天黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚的森林过于危险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,无法保证你们能平安离开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们绝对不可能平安离开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 今晚就破例允许你们在此过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们借住一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,天亮后就立刻…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔夫拉姆大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能让外人进入绿之馆…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,希尔黛 这是大小姐的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,希尔黛大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说是今晚能让我们在领主府上过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是大小姐的城堡 绿之馆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一会儿赶我们走 一会儿要我们住下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.37,0:20:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这座村庄…果然有内情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是刑具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.27,0:20:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怀尔德说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那些是魔女审判的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越玄乎了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:20:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 那边的矮子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.63,0:21:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 还没自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她在问您的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫夏尔·凡多姆海伍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉她说了很失礼的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,多大了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷今年13岁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,掉下去就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是绿之馆
